    {
      "id": "g_planned",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1220,
      "y": -1070,
      "width": 1380,
      "height": 550,
      "color": "#4A90E2",
      "label": "PLANNED R307S INTEGRATION & PHASES (BLUE)"
    },
    {
      "id": "phases_node",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Current engineering sequence\r\n- Repository audit and test infrastructure completed; previous work is preserved.\r\n- Production firmware implements match, explicit enrollment, RTC-gated event, checksummed LittleFS queue, Wi-Fi/API sync and replay.\r\n- Final software evidence: production + compatibility and 25/25 test environments build; backend 10/10 tests pass. No physical integration result is claimed.\r\n- Next: safe electrical measurements, isolated UART loopback/R307S, standalone OLED/RTC/outputs, then synthetic API/queue outage test.\r\n- Dashboard and report routes remain planned.",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": -1010,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 460,
      "color": "#4A90E2"
    },
    {
